#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Launch/Launch-system.rst:16
msgid "Integrating launch files into ROS 2 packages - tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Launch/Launch-system.rst:19
msgid ""
"Launch files can be stored inside ROS packages so they can be built, "
"installed, and run consistently. This article shows how to add launch files "
"to Python and C++ packages using the standard package structure. After you "
"follow these steps, you can run installed XML, YAML, or Python launch files "
"with ``ros launch``."
msgstr ""

